invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-trust-separation.sh
reason: a host object stops carrying x25519_wide.c, and its link fails on
  x25519_wide and x25519_wide_base, which widemul.h calls, only where
  something links it. lint-trust-separation's X25519 rows require the
  file in every host object's source list.

--- old
ifneq ($(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF),)
LIB_SRCS += x25519_wide.c
endif
--- new
